## Strategic Context

### M&A Role in Strategy

M&A is a key lever in MedSync's growth strategy, complementing organic growth. Target allocations:

| Period | Organic | Inorganic | Rationale |
|--------|---------|-----------|-----------|
| 2025 | 90% | 10% | Focus on IPO readiness |
| 2026-2027 | 75% | 25% | Accelerate post-IPO |
| 2028-2029 | 70% | 30% | Platform expansion |

### M&A Objectives

| Objective | Priority | Examples |
|-----------|----------|----------|
| Technology Acceleration | High | AI/ML capabilities |
| Market Expansion | High | New segments, geographies |
| Product Expansion | Medium | Adjacent capabilities |
| Talent Acquisition | Medium | Engineering teams |
| Competitive Defense | Low | Preemptive moves |

