## M&A Criteria

### Strategic Fit

| Criterion | Weight | Definition |
|-----------|--------|------------|
| Strategic Alignment | 30% | Fits product/market strategy |
| Technology Value | 25% | Differentiated technology |
| Market Access | 20% | New customers/segments |
| Team Quality | 15% | Strong talent |
| Cultural Fit | 10% | Values alignment |

### Financial Criteria

| Criterion | Target |
|-----------|--------|
| Revenue Multiple | < 5x ARR (growth adjusted) |
| EBITDA Multiple | < 20x (if profitable) |
| Payback Period | < 3 years |
| Dilution | < 5% per deal |
| Integration Cost | < 15% of deal value |

### Deal Size Parameters

| Category | Range | Frequency |
|----------|-------|-----------|
| Tuck-in | $5M-$25M | 2-3/year |
| Strategic | $25M-$100M | 1/year |
| Transformational | $100M+ | Opportunistic |

