## Risk Management

### M&A Risks

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Overpayment | Disciplined valuation, walk away |
| Integration failure | Experienced team, playbook |
| Key talent loss | Retention packages, culture |
| Customer churn | Communication, service focus |
| Technology debt | Deep technical diligence |
| Cultural mismatch | Cultural assessment, integration |

### Deal Breakers

| Issue | Threshold |
|-------|-----------|
| Security issues | Any significant breach history |
| Legal/IP | Unresolvable disputes |
| Customer concentration | >40% single customer |
| Key person dependency | Unable to retain |
| Cultural misalignment | Fundamental conflicts |

